OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas starts in February for
OL,4,Afestive advert creators
OL,5,
OL,6,FNovember may be associated with darker
OL,7,Fnights and colder weather, but it also
OL,8,Fholds a significant spot on the
OL,9,Fcultural calendar - Christmas advert
OL,10,Fseason.
OL,12,FFrom the sentimental to the silly,
OL,13,Fhigh-street brands vye for this year's
OL,14,Fviral moment, often in the form of
OL,15,Fshort films and highly consumable
OL,16,Fcontent. But for the creative minds
OL,17,Fbehind the campaigns, the festive
OL,18,Fperiod starts in February.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
