OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas starts in February for
OL,4,Afestive advert creators
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You get January not thinking about
OL,7,FChristmas and then you're sort of back
OL,8,Fin it again. I still love Christmas.
OL,9,FIt's not ruined it for me, thankfully,"
OL,10,FJack Croft jokes.
OL,12,FThe 37-year-old, from Wakefield, has
OL,13,Fevery reason to be sick of the sight of
OL,14,Ftinsel or holly - he is an executive
OL,15,Fcreative director at London-based
OL,16,FWonderhood Studios, which has produced
OL,17,Fretailer Waitrose's festive ads since
OL,18,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
